@prefix kg: <https://example.org/zju-srtp/kg/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

kg:Project a rdfs:Class .
kg:Region a rdfs:Class .
kg:Domain a rdfs:Class .
kg:Indicator a rdfs:Class .
kg:Feature a rdfs:Class .
kg:Period a rdfs:Class .
kg:Event a rdfs:Class .
kg:Observation a rdfs:Class .
kg:DataSource a rdfs:Class .

kg:measures a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain kg:Observation ; rdfs:range kg:Indicator .
kg:observedIn a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain kg:Observation ; rdfs:range kg:Region .
kg:atTime a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain kg:Observation ; rdfs:range kg:Period .
kg:fromSource a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain kg:Observation ; rdfs:range kg:DataSource .
kg:affects a rdf:Property .
kg:proxiesFor a rdf:Property .
kg:derivesFeature a rdf:Property .
kg:value a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
kg:unit a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
kg:qualityFlag a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
